    <!-- Privacy Policy Section Start -->
    <section class="service-details-section fix section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="service-details-wrapper">
                        <div class="service-details-content">
                            <p class="mb-3"><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 2026</p>
                            <p class="mb-4">At KLASSICKAPITAL, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring
                                the security of your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,
                                use, and safeguard your data when you use our AI-powered trading tools, indicators,
                                signals, and alerts platform.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">We collect information that you provide directly to us when using our
                                services:</p>

                            <h5 class="mt-4 mb-3">Personal Information</h5>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>Name and contact information (email address, phone number)</li>
                                <li>Account credentials and login information</li>
                                <li>Payment and billing information (processed securely through third-party payment
                                    processors)</li>
                                <li>Referral codes and referral program participation data</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h5 class="mt-4 mb-3">Usage Information</h5>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>Trading preferences and system configuration settings</li>
                                <li>Platform usage data and interaction with our tools</li>
                                <li>Support communications via WhatsApp, Telegram, and email</li>
                                <li>Technical data including IP address, browser type, and device information</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> To provide access to the KLASSICKAPITAL SYSTEM,
                                    including real-time trade execution, signals, alerts, and AI-powered trading tools
                                </li>
                                <li><strong>Account Management:</strong> To create and manage your account, process your
                                    one-time payment of $300, and deliver system access</li>
                                <li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> To provide setup assistance and technical support
                                    through our support channels</li>
                                <li><strong>Referral Program:</strong> To process and track referrals and distribute
                                    referral bonuses</li>
                                <li><strong>Communication:</strong> To send you important updates, system notifications,
                                    and educational content</li>
                                <li><strong>Improvement:</strong> To enhance our AI algorithms, trading tools, and
                                    overall user experience</li>
                                <li><strong>Security:</strong> To protect against unauthorized access and ensure
                                    platform integrity</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">3. Data Sharing and Third Parties</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">We share your information only in the following circumstances:</p>

                            <h5 class="mt-4 mb-3">Service Providers</h5>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> PayPal, Paystack, Flutterwave, and
                                    cryptocurrency payment providers for secure transaction processing</li>
                                <li><strong>TradingView:</strong> Our platform integrates with TradingView for chart
                                    analysis and trade execution</li>
                                <li><strong>Communication Platforms:</strong> WhatsApp and Telegram for customer support
                                </li>
                                <li><strong>Email Service Providers:</strong> For sending account updates and
                                    newsletters</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h5 class="mt-4 mb-3">Legal Requirements</h5>
                            <p class="mb-4">We may disclose your information if required by law, court order, or
                                government regulation, or to protect our rights and the safety of our users.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">4. TradingView Integration</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                Our system integrates seamlessly with TradingView for mobile and desktop trading. When
                                you use our tools on TradingView, certain data may be shared with TradingView in
                                accordance with their privacy policy. We recommend reviewing TradingView's privacy
                                policy for more information about how they handle your data.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">5. Data Security</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information:
                            </p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li>SSL encryption for all data transmission</li>
                                <li>Secure payment processing through trusted third-party providers</li>
                                <li>Regular security audits and system monitoring</li>
                                <li>Access controls and authentication measures</li>
                                <li>Encrypted storage of sensitive information</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure. While we strive to
                                protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience on our
                                platform:
                            </p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for platform functionality and security
                                </li>
                                <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how users interact with our
                                    platform</li>
                                <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Remember your settings and trading preferences
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="mb-4">You can control cookie settings through your browser, but disabling certain
                                cookies may limit platform functionality.</p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">7. Your Rights and Choices</h3>
                            <p class="mb-3">You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you</li>
                                <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update or correct inaccurate information</li>
                                <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data (subject to legal
                                    obligations)</li>
                                <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time</li>
                                <li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable format</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p class="mb-4">To exercise these rights, contact us at <a
                                    href="mailto:support@klassickapital.com">support@klassickapital.com</a></p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">8. Data Retention</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to provide our services and
                                comply with legal obligations. Account information is retained while your account is
                                active and for a reasonable period thereafter for legal and business purposes.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">9. Children's Privacy</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                Our services are not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly
                                collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently
                                collected information from a minor, please contact us immediately.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">10. International Users</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                KLASSICKAPITAL serves a global community of over 66,000 traders. If you access our
                                services from outside your country of residence, please note that your information may
                                be transferred to and processed in different jurisdictions. By using our services, you
                                consent to such transfers.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">11. Educational Purpose</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                As stated in our Disclaimer, all content and tools provided by KLASSICKAPITAL are for
                                educational purposes only. We do not collect or use your data to provide financial
                                advice. Your trading decisions and their consequences remain your sole responsibility.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
                            <p class="mb-4">
                                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices
                                or legal requirements. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the updated
                                policy on our website and updating the "Last updated" date. Continued use of our
                                services after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
                            </p>

                            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">13. Contact Us</h3>
                            <p class="mb-2">If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data
                                practices, please contact us:</p>
                            <ul class="list-items mb-4">
                                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a
                                        href="mailto:support@klassickapital.com">support@klassickapital.com</a></li>
                                <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+2347032285613">+234 703 228 5613</a></li>
                                <li><strong>Support:</strong> Available via WhatsApp and Telegram</li>
                            </ul>

                            <div class="mt-5 pt-4"
                                style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-left: 4px solid var(--theme-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px;">
                                <h5 class="mb-3">Your Privacy Matters</h5>
                                <p class="mb-0">
                                    At KLASSICKAPITAL, we are committed to transparency and protecting your privacy. We
                                    only use your information to provide you with the best trading tools and support
                                    possible. If you have any concerns about how we handle your data, please don't
                                    hesitate to reach out to our support team.
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-top">
                                <p class="text-muted mb-0"><small><strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 2026</small>
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

